<title>USA: TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the $328,000 AT&amp;T</p>
<p>men's clay court tennis tournament final on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seed):</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 7-Jason Stoltenberg</p>
<p>(Australia) 7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
</text>
